WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:05.600
Policy Harm Index — Canadian Legislative Changes That Increased Death Rates.

00:00:05.550 --> 00:00:15.000
Every entry documents a Canadian legislative or policy change with a measurable, publicly reported increase in preventable death or mortality rate.

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:23.562
Sources: Statistics Canada, Health Canada, CIHI, Auditor General, coroner reports, peer-reviewed epidemiology.

00:00:23.562 --> 00:00:28.650
These are not opinions — these are numbers the government published about itself.
